{"id":"621068","name":"酱护心肉","author":"不做妖精好多年","authorId":"1806550","desc":"*本菜谱为作者独家发布于美食天下，禁止其他平台或个人转载。","cover":"images/621068/cover.jpg","ingredients":{"main":[{"name":"护心肉","amount":"1000g"}],"sub":[{"name":"清水","amount":"若干"}]},"steps":[{"step":1,"desc":"护心肉洗净，冷水下锅焯水。","img":"images/621068/step_1.jpg"},{"step":2,"desc":"取卤肉料，和葱姜。","img":"images/621068/step_2.jpg"},{"step":3,"desc":"放陈皮。","img":"images/621068/step_3.jpg"},{"step":4,"desc":"倒压力锅内锅里。","img":"images/621068/step_4.jpg"},{"step":5,"desc":"护心肉煮开3分钟。","img":"images/621068/step_5.jpg"},{"step":6,"desc":"洗净浮沫放锅里。","img":"images/621068/step_6.jpg"},{"step":7,"desc":"放白糖。","img":"images/621068/step_7.jpg"},{"step":8,"desc":"放甜面酱和黄豆酱。","img":"images/621068/step_8.jpg"},{"step":9,"desc":"放食盐。","img":"images/621068/step_9.jpg"},{"step":10,"desc":"放酒樱桃。","img":"images/621068/step_10.jpg"},{"step":11,"desc":"最后放生抽和清水，搅拌均匀。","img":"images/621068/step_11.jpg"},{"step":12,"desc":"入高压锅，选快煮饭，口感偏软。","img":"images/621068/step_12.jpg"},{"step":13,"desc":"煮好的酱肉。","img":"images/621068/step_13.jpg"},{"step":14,"desc":"取出来摆盘。","img":"images/621068/step_14.jpg"},{"step":15,"desc":"成品。","img":"images/621068/step_15.jpg"}],"tips":"如果时间充足，可以用砂锅来酱。 \n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t来自 美食天下  的作品\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t使用的厨具：电压力锅、煮锅\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t所属分类：","attrs":{}}